+| `vfqwmmacc.vv vd, vs1, vs2[, v0.scale]` | 4 | SEW/4   | SEW | floating point and MX scaled A/B tiles
+| `vfwimmacc.vv vd, vs1, vs2, v0.scale`  | 2 | SEW/2   | SEW | only MX-scaled integer A/B tiles
+| `vfqwimmacc.vv vd, vs1, vs2, v0.scale` | 4 | SEW/4   | SEW | only MX-scaled integer A/B tiles
