+==== Integer encoding map
+
+`altfmt_A` and `altfmt_B` select signed (0) or unsigned (1) interpretation; the accumulator is always signed.
+`altfmt` is unused and `vm` must be 1 (`vm=0` is _reserved_) for all three instructions.
+For `vwmmacc.vv` and `vqwmmacc.vv`, `vm=0` is separately defined as `vfwimmacc.vv` and
+`vfqwimmacc.vv` (integer inputs, FP accumulator, E8M0 microscaling); see <<tbl-intmx-encoding-map>>.
